00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:14,570
When writing an introduction paragraph about a character, you need to introduce name, age, outstanding characteristics of the character.

2
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:27,770
About talent, personality, emotion, contribution, influence of that character on yourself or on everyone.

3
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:40,400
You need to show your thoughts, emotions about the character.

